{
  "lore": "Before the Calamity, the Meridian Institute ran Project CHIMERA alongside its Ouroboros Ring transmutation research: a classified programme that fused unstable elements into living animals. They called the results Elementals. When the Institute fell in the Containment Breach of Year 301, the creatures escaped. Afterwards, Institute survivors ran Project REVERSION to turn them back into ordinary animals. It backfired: every reversal treatment sped the fusion up instead, so the treated subjects lost most of what made them animals and became golem-like, spectral or ooze-like things. Their file notes still record which animal each one was. They roam the world now, drawn to the elemental concentrations that birthed them.",

